    'snack.C.title': 'THE SAVIOR BORN',
    'snack.C.verse': 'For unto you is born this day in the city of David a Savior, who is Christ the Lord.',
    'snack.C.prayer': 'Father, today we celebrate the greatest gift ever given. Jesus, thank You for stepping into our world, for becoming one of us, and for bringing light into our darkness.',
    'snack.E.title': 'RESURRECTION LIFE',
